      "text_unit_id": "tu_0001",
      "verbatim_text": "In patients with ischemic heart disease, who either survive SCA due to VT/VF or experience hemodynamically unstable VT (LOE: B-R) (S7.1.1-1–S7.1.1-4) or stable sustained VT (LOE: B-NR) (S7.1.1-5) not due to reversible causes, an ICD is recommended if meaningful survival greater than 1 year is expected."
